# Functions allowed to write an invoice or a credit note: <path>::<impl type>::<fn> | class | reason.
# A subscription's period, final and consolidated documents are the billing controller's
# (lifecycle::derived); a change writes its own adjustment invoice and notes in its transaction.
# Keep it short and current: an entry whose function no longer writes a document fails the check.

# Primitives: each builds one kind of document; their callers are checked.
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/invoices/draft.rs::Services::create_subscription_draft_invoice_unboxed | primitive | a subscription period's or final draft
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/invoices/draft.rs::Services::create_subscription_draft_invoice | primitive | boxes the period's or final draft
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/invoices/draft.rs::Services::create_adjustment_invoice_from_content | primitive | a change's adjustment invoice
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/invoices/draft.rs::Services::create_adjustment_invoice | primitive | prices then builds a change's adjustment invoice
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/invoices/draft.rs::Services::create_oneoff_draft_invoice | primitive | an operator's one-off invoice
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/invoices/draft.rs::Services::create_corrected_invoice_from_tx | primitive | the invoice correcting a voided one
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/invoices/draft.rs::Services::create_corrected_invoice_from | primitive | the same, in its own transaction
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/invoices/consolidate.rs::Services::build_and_finalize_consolidated | primitive | a consolidated invoice over its members' drafts
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/invoices/consolidate.rs::Services::consolidate_and_finalize | primitive | finalizes a customer's same-day drafts as one invoice
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/subscriptions/slots.rs::Services::seat_purchase_invoice_tx | primitive | a seat purchase's adjustment invoice, issued or left a draft
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/repositories/credit_notes.rs::create_user_credit_note_tx | primitive | a credit note against one invoice
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/repositories/invoices.rs::Store::insert_invoice | primitive | an invoice as given, the API's and the imports'
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/edge.rs::ServicesEdge::create_corrected_invoice_from | primitive | the correction, through the edge
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/invoices/bill.rs::Services::bill_subscription_with_data_tx | primitive | a period's or final invoice from its draft, priced and issued
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/invoices/bill.rs::Services::bill_subscription_tx | primitive | the same, its data read
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/invoices/bill.rs::Services::bill_period_tx | primitive | a period's invoice
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/invoices/bill.rs::Services::bill_final_invoice_tx | primitive | an ending's final invoice

# The billing controller.
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/lifecycle/derived.rs::Services::write_document_tx | writer | each document a step makes due
modules/meteroid/crates/meteroid-store/src/services/lifecycle/controller.rs::Services::finalize_after_grace | writer | merges the drafts whose grace ended into the customer's consolidated invoice

